### ===================================
### Project Management API Tests
### Base Path: /rangi_windows/api
### ===================================

### ----- Project CRUD -----

### List Projects (Default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects

###

### List Projects with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?page=1&pageSize=20

###

### List Projects with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?q=kitchen

###

### List Projects with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?glass=true&frame=false&page=1&pageSize=20

###

### List Projects with Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?start=2024-01-01&end=2024-12-31

###

### List Projects with Sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc

###

### List Archived Projects Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?archived=true

###

### Include Archived Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?includeArchived=true

###

### Complex Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects?q=window&glass=true&purchase=true&start=2024-01-01&page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc

###

### Get Project by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1

###

### Create Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Kitchen Windows",
  "description": "Replace all kitchen windows",
  "clientName": "John Doe",
  "clientPhone": "123-456-7890",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "stages": {
    "glass": false,
    "frame": false,
    "purchase": false,
    "transport": false,
    "install": false,
    "repair": false
  }
}

###

### Update Project (Full)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Kitchen Windows",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "clientName": "John Doe",
  "clientPhone": "123-456-7890",
  "address": "123 Main St, Apt 2"
}

###

### Partial Update Project
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Partially updated description"
}

###

### Archive Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/archive

###

### Unarchive Project (toggle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/archive

###

### Delete Project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1

###

### ----- Stage Operations -----

### Update Stages
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "glass": true,
  "frame": true,
  "purchase": false
}

###

### Mark All Stages Complete
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "glass": true,
  "frame": true,
  "purchase": true,
  "transport": true,
  "install": true,
  "repair": true
}

###

### ----- Photo Operations -----

### List Project Photos
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/photos

###

### Upload Photo
# Note: Use multipart/form-data in actual request
POST {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

### Download Photo by Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/photo/abc123token

###

### Delete Photo by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/photos/1

###

### Delete Photo by Token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/photo/abc123token

###

### Delete All Photos
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/projects/1/photos
